uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75297580_265075942383861_4557208847552725230_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hYim3JDlwmQQ7kNvwEwg_dA&_nc_oc=AdpL0Acczqih_mu7FzlJ5MyLyjdyrOC3HysyqZ5gslf1zF0yUt83UbRz-bI9z8yAAS4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHXSDcU4uyvDpJ0quN-oEYq3fuRnhMEV7Q8Vgr_J8E0hw&oe=6A859044"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "image_026_0000.png", "id": "1663884603977026", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75451777_1663884610643692_5999330319497865154_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iNY37OQeUXEQ7kNvwGOrlEH&_nc_oc=AdoGvgDegUnjEvMzctRnuzGSQpAeZCleui2Lo1dpoZ3HhAUY7GwjTkJX5QMt7tofya0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEgmsLkpJwgRET4jRNI7kfiig0kvdTdf-EvIhCzbLpFRg&oe=6A858E4A"}, "display_name": "Virtual Chess", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Play chess with your friends, with random people online or against the computer in a beautiful VR environment.\n\nThe game supports many different platforms - VR, smart phones, tablets, smart TVs, so you can play with your friends even if they don't use a VR headset.\n\nThere are also many online players that you can play with and the rating algorithm will make sure that you're matched with opponents of a similar strength, so you can always enjoy an interesting and competitive game.\n\nThe game has many different features besides the standard chess gameplay, including:\n- tens of thousands of interesting puzzles, where you need to find a possible checkmate within 1, 2 or 3 moves.\n- ability to analyze your games and see where you made mistakes, what better moves you could have played, what was the balance (your winning chances) at each move, etc.\n- you can optionally create an account and maintain your progress across multiple devices\n- and many others!\n\nWe hope you like it!", "short_description": "Play chess with your friends, with 